#: data/maps/SlateportCity_House/scripts.inc:12
msgctxt "SlateportCity_House_Text_NatureToDoWithStatGains"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON has a HASTY nature.\p"
"It has higher SPEED compared to\n"
"my other POKéMON.\p"
"Maybe their nature has something to\n"
"do with the stat gains of POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦是急躁的性格。\p"
"和我其他的宝可梦相比，它的速度更高。\p"
"也许宝可梦的性格和能力的成长有关系。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_House/scripts.inc:19
msgctxt "SlateportCity_House_Text_MustBeGoingToBattleTent"
msgid ""
"You're a TRAINER, aren't you?\p"
"Since you came to SLATEPORT CITY,\n"
"you must be going to the BATTLE TENT.$"
msgstr ""
"你是训练家吧？\p"
"既然来到了凯那市，\n"
"你一定是要去对战帐篷吧。$"
